blocks.text:
I am glad to see you in such high spirits about the land, and I hope you
      will remain so, if you never get richer. I seldom venture to think about
      our landed wealth, for &ldquo;hope deferred maketh the heart sick.&rdquo;

fields.signature:
The mine relocated in this letter was not the &ldquo;Wide West,&rdquo; but it
furnished the proper incident.  The only mention of the &ldquo;Wide West&rdquo;
 is found in a letter written in July.
